date-released: 2026-10-08
abstract: >-
  CellBridge fits one closed-form slope per protein and predicts a donor's
  protein change from RNA and eight anchor antibodies. On GSE334503 the
  prespecified sequence beat the mean, two ridges and totalVI. On E-MTAB-9357
  the same frozen method stopped at the primary-endpoint comparison with the
  mean. A Zenodo DOI is not assigned yet.
